# uv.lock is intentionally NOT ignored. It arrived in this file's initial
# commit alongside .venv/, __pycache__/ and .pytest_cache/ -- all derived
# artifacts -- but a lock is an input, and issue #160 Gate 7 requires a
# dependency lock sufficient for clean reproduction of every paper. An
# ignored lock makes that gate permanently unclosable.
